{"server":"cn","storyId":"story_lumen_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_lumen_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"直到灯火明亮","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_lumen_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"dc12ff41c75bd6bf50fc652ae3063fbbe00aa389393e3e674bfb5a56a21d1946","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"流明答应替受伤的信使递送包裹，这件包裹却给寂静的格兰法洛带来了一些波澜。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......“出于安全性考虑，接口装置能够采用的......现有的最佳替代材料......”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，这个预估材料消耗的数量级，是不是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......不对，这些是早期的笔记，如果她弄错了，她一定会划掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那......“伊比利亚之眼”，该有多大？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，如果它亮起来的话，从格兰法洛的每一扇窗户向外望，都能看到它的灯光......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，这个应该是传说吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后是照明强度测试......图示这么清晰，总觉得照着就能做出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，小镇上好像没有能做出试验品的材料......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请稍等一下！我这就来开门！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"年轻的护工手忙脚乱地将笔记本塞进杂物柜，提起手边的灯，快步穿过礼拜堂。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"时间已经很晚了，请问您来礼拜堂有什么——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——信、信使先生？！您怎么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......别着急，我扶您进来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您先在门口躺一下，我新洗过的纱布就在旁边......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"门......先关上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......整齐的刀伤，连着硬质皮带一起砍断了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，我应该有办法处理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过您需要在这里多养几天伤......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......逃过一劫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是、是啊，您来得很及时，毕竟我能做的很少，如果伤口感染了的话，就没办法了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你真奇怪，连我是怎么受伤的都不问。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"还是说，住在这座小镇的家伙都这样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我只是觉得当务之急是给您止血......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您突然这么问，我也不知道怎么回答。这座小镇之外是什么样子，我其实不太了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我记忆里，很少有外地人到格兰法洛来，离开的人，也不再回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"格兰法洛......就是这样的地方啊。离海很近，离审判庭也很近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，是这样，就连您这样的信使也不太停留......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......抱歉，我还不知道您的名字。信使们每次急匆匆地来，接着又急匆匆地走，一般不会有空来礼拜堂歇脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我是......咳，对了，你应该对格兰法洛很熟悉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想还算熟悉？我一直在这里生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，很久以前发生的事、广场、广场上的雕像，还有大海......那些我只听叔叔说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"那也够多啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真不好意思，你帮我疗伤，已经是帮了我很大的忙了......但是，我还有别的事情得拜托你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"这个包裹是送到格兰法洛的，不过没有具体的地址和收件人姓名，只写了“插着白花的门扉”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"插着白花？我不记得镇上有这样的人家......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我很清楚自己的伤势，这几天恐怕不方便在小镇里四处走动，寻找这个收件人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"但是这个包裹......只有送出去了我才能安心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，没问题，交给我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好沉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，等天亮了我就去找人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，我再拿两条毯子来。虽然东西都是旧的，但您一定能温暖地过夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......要小心啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些年轻人，真是越来越不谨慎了！再这样下去，审判庭的人迟早要被他们引来，把这二十年的平静都毁了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"劝我冷静点讲道理......审判庭的那帮家伙什么时候讲过道理？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，剩下的汤都是你的了，孩子。太咸了，我不爱喝......你也是，最近尤其要小心，别让人注意到你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好的，蒂亚戈叔叔，下次我煮汤一定注意......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......镇上出什么事了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没什么，只是又有多管闲事的家伙来格兰法洛四处打探了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，两个只知道向审判庭打报告的教士，不知道是嗅着什么味道来了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"格兰法洛绝对没有他们想要的东西，他们难道看不出来吗？......这里已经什么都没有了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......礼拜堂那边有什么事吗？你还在看你父母留下的笔记？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......读起来还挺有趣的，不知不觉一天就过去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不要让其他人看到你在读那些笔记，我记得他们是用阿戈尔语做的记录。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道，蒂亚戈叔叔。我会小心的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当初我只是想，把它们藏在最危险的地方，也许反而不会被审判庭查到。我只是想，不能让那帮匪徒带走格兰法洛的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于有没有人会看，我没想过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在这些资料能当作你打发时间的消遣，那也值了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叔叔，您能把这些东西保留下来，我真的很感激。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，今天晚上礼拜堂来了一个——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"门外的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亚戈，我们有事得跟你报告！咱们必须在审判庭盯上格兰法洛之前把这事处理了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（压低声音）乔迪！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我明白......！我先去房间里，把门关上......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们搞清楚了，那两个教士在追的是信使，不是我们镇上的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但麻烦就麻烦在，他们怀疑信使在替一些阿戈尔人传递消息。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......咳，别摆那种脸色，蒂亚戈，你知道不是我们要怀疑阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，我们刚刚去过礼拜堂了。那个信使被教士打伤了，在礼拜堂歇息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......礼拜堂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你放心，我们有意等乔迪离开礼拜堂，才把教士带去那里。谁都没说乔迪的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们跟他关系这么好，怎么可能让他被这种莫名其妙的事情牵连进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然后，那个信使把他所有的行李都交给教士检查了，里面没有任何可疑的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这事多半又是......一场误会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，误会！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......情况我明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"接下来，让大家都安分守己地过几天日子，谁也别提这件事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只要......我们都低着头忍耐一阵子，这事就可以当作没发生过，审判庭不会再来打扰我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"积极的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_462_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我去通知其他人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人寄出的，可疑的东西，呃......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"乔迪抱起门后用墨绿绒布层层包住的物件，贴上去闻了闻。\n他不确定那种会令蒂亚戈叔叔皱眉的咸味，究竟是来自手中的包裹，还是来自格兰法洛四季不变的潮湿空气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我自己去找。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"镇上的人都很善良，我不觉得他们会做什么需要被抓走的坏事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蒂亚戈叔叔说过，很多年前，格兰法洛还住着不少阿戈尔人。也许只是有人不知道自己的朋友已经离开了，才把东西寄了过来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......自己去看看收件人是谁！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......广场东边的街区都走过一遍了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明天清晨再出来找其他地方吧。按照蒂亚戈叔叔的说法，那两位教士早晨七点就会四处巡视了，我得赶快回家才行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还好，已经三天了，教士们应该也准备离开了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“插着白花的门扉”......可是绝大多数人的屋子都已经漆成了白色，应该不会喜欢用白花装饰吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，刚刚路过的那幢房子，门上好像有什么白色的......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，好像看错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是花，而是......挂着一本书？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这......是不是有点奇怪？我记得这里应该很久没人住了，但这本书是新的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好吧，我敲门试试。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......似乎没有人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，还是没有人应答，我应该是想太多了吧......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我顺着这条街往上走，你去另一边看看，看到不对劲的就踹门进去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"陌生的声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"这个小镇应该只有这附近我们没查过了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（没听过的声音，口音也很陌生......应该就是那两位外来的教士了。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我得躲起来！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（从这里往回走，不知道会不会与他们撞上。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（要是我真的被发现了，一定会给蒂亚戈叔叔带去很多麻烦吧......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（——脚步声靠近了。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"温和的女性声音","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"早上好，年轻有为的教士。这座小镇上很少见到您这样的外来者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（刚刚那扇门......开了？而且，我听过这个声音。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g16_lighthouse_street"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢当，我的同龄人之中，已经有人跻身审判官的行列。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，您似乎比这座小镇的大多数人更接近我们的信仰，而不是一味地恐惧审判庭的裁决。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只不过是从文字中获得过一些浅薄的知识，理解审判庭在与什么样的危机对抗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果这座小镇里真的存在您担忧的东西，我建议去那个方向搜寻。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您有线索？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，我从未见过任何异常，因此我才选择在这座宁静的小镇落脚，安心做我的文书工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只不过大海就在那个方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"年轻的教士","speakerId":"avg_npc_460_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您是说只可能在镇外......我明白了，谢谢。当然，那已经超出我们两位普通教士的能力范围了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，礼拜堂的乔迪。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......呃，您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想问一下......这个是不是寄给您的东西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不想知道里面是什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？......不，我怎么可能怀疑您呢，阿玛雅小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在格兰法洛，您懂的比大家都多，蒂亚戈叔叔也说，您帮他想了很多办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，进来看看吧，我希望你能心安一些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibbar"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我最近刚托人把这幢废弃的房子收拾好，用来保存家里放不下的书籍和文稿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有......或许以后有人愿意来这里坐一坐，看看格兰法洛，乃至整个伊比利亚之外的故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你捎来的包裹里也是一些书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你认识这些文字吗？都是阿戈尔语。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，勉强能读懂......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以这些确实是阿戈尔人寄来的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你能读懂，那就随意翻看一下吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这本是在说戏剧......舞台装置......什么的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这本是剧院建筑设计......里面的设计图，看起来真厉害啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿玛雅小姐，您难道在研究戏剧吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么可能，我只不过是个不入流的翻译家罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这些书只是我的一位朋友在家中发现的旧物，应该是那场灾难之后一些阿戈尔人凭记忆重新写就的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灾难？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，不用在意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，她特意把这些书寄给我，希望我翻译成伊比利亚的语言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"阿戈尔人的文字，在这个陆上国家难以保存，仅此而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，这些书籍如果让不懂阿戈尔语的教士们看到，确实会产生误会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......您听起来这么难过，是因为阿戈尔人的境遇吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是吧......但也不止是阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个，我自己其实已经习惯这样的生活了，哈哈......我觉得没什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过我也知道，自己不能代表阿戈尔人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想知道，在其他地方，阿戈尔人也是这样生活的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其他地方是什么样子......嗯，乔迪，既然你是这里唯一的阿戈尔人，你愿意协助我进行翻译工作吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有你的帮助，我就不必独自翻查那本旧词典了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......欸？不，我觉得自己做不了这么艰深的文书工作......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没关系，只要你想，什么时候都可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，你也可以先在这里尽情阅读自己感兴趣的书籍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"文字也许偶尔会骗人，但不可否认的是，它总会打碎人们的界限，让人看到新的可能性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其中当然也包括你好奇的外界的模样。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_npc_449_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，我的茶壶放在哪里了？请坐吧，乔迪，在这里多待一会，也许就能发现自己感兴趣的东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我得回礼拜堂了，受伤的信使还需要人照顾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的好意，但我......我得先做好护工的工作。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那个年轻人......他不是能够理解的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿玛雅","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他没有梦见过吗？自己有了翅膀，俯瞰着一望无际的大海，每一朵浪花都溶进水中......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"乔迪？你去哪里了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你答应过七点前回来的，孩子。我叮嘱过你，不要到处乱跑，那两名教士多半今天就会离开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱、抱歉，叔叔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我去照顾一下伤员，然后就去里间待着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那几个年轻人帮你照看过伤员了。他们想让你安心在家里躲着。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，那我下次再跟他们道谢......今天我就躲在这里，应该也没关系的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看，我就在这里，关起门来点上灯看书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这盏灯......还能用？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我按照笔记上说的试了一下，不知道算不算修好，但现在至少能发光了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"......\n对不起，我没能让这盏灯挂在这里......我决不允许它挂在审判庭用于监视格兰法洛的这座礼拜堂里。\n而且，它被摔坏了。在驻守的惩戒军冲出礼拜堂的那个晚上之后，它就再也不亮了。\n我打算把它和你们的笔记一起放在箱子里，如果足够幸运，它们也许能保存下去。但我不会为此祈祷。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_ibchurch"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......继续看吧，孩子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蒂亚戈","speakerId":"avg_npc_451_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我先走了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，信使先生，您醒过来了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那两位教士已经离开格兰法洛了，您不用再这么提心吊胆了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，还有，包裹我也已经送到了。请放心，您没有做什么坏事，我看到了包裹里的东西，一切都是一场误会......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"......拉莱多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我叫拉莱多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，作为信使，我知道自己容易惹上麻烦，也想尽量避免更多的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我叫乔迪。我明白您的担忧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，总之，您的伤口也恢复得很好，我想这两天您就能恢复行动自如的状态了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，乔迪，你难道喜欢这个地方吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我......我说不上来。为什么突然问这个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"这里离审判庭太近，或许跟他们还有过节。在我看来，这里充满危险，同时被迫维持着死气沉沉的状态。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"对于你这个阿戈尔人来说，应该更是如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我已经一天都不想在这里多待了，你难道没想过离开这里，出去看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你如果是担心出了格兰法洛不知道往哪里去，正好可以跟我一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"北边无人的荒野看起来凶险，但我也知道比较安全的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"我还知道几座像样的城市，对阿戈尔人比较宽容。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"你这样的阿戈尔人也有机会做梦，然后实现梦想。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉莱多，外面的人是否更熟悉大海，您知道吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外面的人......会谈论大灯塔，聊起“伊比利亚之眼”的传说吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"别傻了，乔迪，人们不会随便提起海。至于大灯塔，那是只有你们格兰法洛的人才会讲给自己孩子听的东西。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢您的好意，拉莱多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我还不能走。不看到海和灯塔的话，我不能走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"地方信使","speakerId":"avg_npc_178","isRemote":false,"text":"可是格兰法洛已经失败了。那种黄金时代伊比利亚的幻梦，早在几十年前就结束了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请别这么说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那不只是伊比利亚的，也是阿戈尔人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"乔迪","speakerId":"avg_4042_lumen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是一个阿戈尔人的梦想啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
